T Soak test
E  Dir DAT                | DIR B:*.DAT
EP Dir SUB, pause         | DIR B:*.SUB
S  Nested S entry         | SOAKB S M
SP Nested S entry, pause  | SOAKB SP M
E  MSUB from the menu     | MSUB SOAKB E M
C  Chain STAT             | A:STAT B:
CP Chain STAT, pause      | A:STAT B:
E! Leave, job continues   | DIR B:SOAKX.*
